# Rules checklist

Every agent self-checks against this list before returning. Before a report is published, the lead
(or a fresh agent with no stake in the findings) re-checks the whole run folder against it. A run with
a gap goes back, not out the door.

- [ ] Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/qa/handoff.md` and the rule file for this task before starting
- [ ] `docs/qa/PRIOR-GAPS.md` checked for rows on a touched surface; tested, not skipped
- [ ] Impact map built from the diff: every shared piece touched, every consumer found on every portal
{{#if has_designs}}
- [ ] Design checked frame by frame, inventory first, newest designs only, for the touched portal
{{/if}}
{{#if sends_email}}
- [ ] Every action that can send mail checked: arrived, once, right people, right template, links work
{{/if}}
- [ ] Every control operated (typed into, toggled, saved), not just looked at — logged in `FIELD-MATRIX.md`
- [ ] Every filter bar has a working Reset / Clear all; "All" checked against every option ticked
- [ ] Any new or changed number, chart or export checked against an independent source, value by value
{{#if has_security}}
- [ ] Role boundaries, cross-account data by changing an id, and script/quote input checked on anything new (`SECURITY-RULES.md`)
{{/if}}
{{#if has_db}}
- [ ] This PR's main write confirmed directly in the database, read-only (`DB-RULES.md`)
{{/if}}
- [ ] Every account state this PR can reach checked, for every role: {{states}}
- [ ] Test users are fresh enough for today's verdict, not stale fixtures reused past their shelf life
- [ ] Every candidate defect reproduced from the screens{{#if sends_email}} or delivered emails{{/if}} only,
      {{rules.recheck_times}} times, by someone other than the finder
- [ ] Every "Expected" traces to the spec, the design, or a named ruling — never a PR description alone
- [ ] Every use case has a status: Pass · Fail → issue · Not covered + reason; "Not covered" is near zero
      and each one says what was tried
- [ ] Shared settings changed during testing are back to their original value, logged in `RESTORE-LOG.md`
- [ ] No password, token, session cookie or card number anywhere in the run folder or the report
- [ ] The report shows only what's still open: fixed, ignored and accepted-behaviour items left out
- [ ] Surprises added to `docs/qa/LESSONS.md`; leftovers added to `docs/qa/PRIOR-GAPS.md`
